          "canonical_heading": "SURGERY",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "if invading adjacent organs, disseminated in thorax, or metastatic, then guarded (median 224 days). Prolonged survival despite no/minimal therapy might result from the indolent nature of the tumor.",
              "pdf_page": 1417,
              "printed_page": 1335,
              "column": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Patients with high lymphocyte proportion in tumor have a more favorable prognosis.",
              "pdf_page": 1417,
              "printed_page": 1335,
